[en.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES]
Tranquil Agarica

[en.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES_desc]
As we all know, fungi cannot move. Do you think they would gather together and sing like little ponies? This is not a Bridleway Opera.

[en.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES_TOOLTIP]
§RCannot train units, disband units, or edit unit templates.§!

[zh.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES]
宁静的阿加里卡

[zh.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES_desc]
众所周知，真菌不能移动。你认为它们会像小马一样聚在一起唱歌？这里可不是百骊汇歌剧。

[zh.IDEA_C58_SECURITY_FORCES_TOOLTIP]
§R无法训练，删除部队，改变部队编制§!
